WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.540
How can two straight lines never meet?

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:06.690
Give them exactly the same slope.

00:00:06.690 --> 00:00:13.400
Same steepness, but different starting points. They stay parallel forever.

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:21.013
For a right angle, flip the slope and change its sign: 2 becomes minus a half.
